    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Looking at the current global landscape, it feels like the whole idea of \"global governance\" is just a way for elites to push a specific agenda while ignoring how people actually live in their own countries. Do you think the shift toward more nationalist policies is just a natural, necessary response to these failing institutions?",
